OLD TOWN ACCOUNTS
NIGHT OPERATOR INSTRUCTIONS          issue 2 / oct 1974

SIGN ON
The night terminal is station 9.  Its UNIX line is /dev/tty9.
Use the shared role and current watchword recorded by the office.
The nightly balance report prints immediately after sign-on.

ACCOUNT INQUIRY
Select account inquiry and enter the four-digit account number.
Accounts retained for the night run may not carry a holder name until
the close clerk finishes reconciliation.

JOURNAL REPRINT
Select journal reprint and enter the entry number.  Standard report
designations are S (summary) and D (detail).  Retired designations must
be handled according to the current technical bulletin on the live
machine.

SIGN OFF
Return to the main selection and choose SIGN OFF.  Do not halt UNIX;
the next operator uses the same station line.
